SUMMARY:[Knowledge Representation & Reasoning][Graphs & Graph Learning] ISW
 C 2026 - Research/resource/in-use abstract deadline
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: International Semantic Web Conference\nWebsit
 e: https://iswc2026.semanticweb.org/\nSource URL: https://iswc2026.semant
 icweb.org/importantdates\nLocation: Bari\, Italy\nTopics: Knowledge Repre
 sentation & Reasoning\, Graphs & Graph Learning\, Data Mining & Data Scie
 nce\, Information Retrieval & Search\nSize: M\nSubmission type: Paper-bas
 ed\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-10-07\nNotes: Semantic
  Web ISWC\, not IEEE Symposium on Wearable Computers. Official JavaScript
 -rendered date table specifies 23:59 AoE\; main sessions October 27-29 af
 ter workshops/tutorials. Size is an editorial estimate.\nScope: Semantic 
 Web and linked-data research: ontologies\, knowledge graphs\, representat
 ion and reasoning\, semantic integration\, querying\, and knowledge-suppo
 rted AI. Graph learning is relevant through semantic data and knowledge s
 tructures\; this is not the IEEE wearable-computing symposium with the sa
 me acronym.\nAdditional topics: Machine Learning\, Explainability & Inter
 pretability\nScope sources (2026): https://iswc2026.semanticweb.org/calls
 /research\nScope last checked: 2026-10-07
