SUMMARY:[Data Mining & Data Science][Machine Learning] WSDM 2027 - Abstract
  submission deadline
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: ACM International Conference on Web Search an
 d Data Mining\nWebsite: https://www.wsdm-conference.org/2027/\nSource URL
 : https://www.wsdm-conference.org/2027/cffp.html\nLocation: Hong Kong\, C
 hina\nTopics: Data Mining & Data Science\, Machine Learning\, Fairness & 
 Responsible AI\, Human-AI Interaction & Deployment\nSize: L\nSubmission t
 ype: Paper-based\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-08-20\nN
 otes: Official WSDM 2027 pages list Hong Kong\, Feb 15-19\, and the abstr
 act/paper deadlines.\nScope: Web search\, ranking\, recommendation and mi
 ning of web and social data. Characteristic extensions include large-scal
 e graph analysis\, conversational retrieval\, foundation-model and agenti
 c web systems\, and fairness and privacy in information access. The broad
  emerging-applications inventory is not treated as evidence that WSDM is 
 a specialist healthcare or climate venue.\nAdditional topics: Information
  Retrieval & Search\, Recommender Systems\, Graphs & Graph Learning\, LLM
  Agents & Tool Use\, Natural Language Processing & LLMs\nScope sources (2
 027): https://www.wsdm-conference.org/2027/cffp.html\nScope last checked:
  2026-10-07
